# NexusAI vs Oracle Fusion: Module-by-Module Parity Assessment
## PART 1: Financial Management Suite
*Page / Form / Field / Granular Level Comparison*

Legend: ✅ = Exists in NexusAI | ⚠️ = Partial / Simplified | ❌ = Missing entirely

---

## Module 1 — General Ledger (GL)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion General Ledger

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [JournalEntries.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/JournalEntries.tsx) — Journal entry list with filters, date/period search
- ✅ [ChartOfAccounts.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ChartOfAccounts.tsx) — COA viewer with segment structure
- ✅ [GeneralLedgerDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/GeneralLedgerDetail.tsx) — Ledger header detail view
- ✅ [AccountReconciliation.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/AccountReconciliation.tsx) — Manual reconciliation console
- ✅ [VarianceAnalysis.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/VarianceAnalysis.tsx) — Budget vs Actual comparison
- ✅ [gl/](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/lib/api.ts#222-223) directory — 47 sub-pages (period close, allocations, subledger transfer, etc.)
- ✅ [IntercompanyEliminations.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/IntercompanyEliminations.tsx) / [IntercompanyReconciliation.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/IntercompanyReconciliation.tsx)
- ✅ [FinancialConsolidation.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/FinancialConsolidation.tsx) — Top-level consolidation engine page
- ✅ [ConsolidationEngine.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ConsolidationEngine.tsx)
- ✅ [BudgetPlanning.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BudgetPlanning.tsx) / [BudgetingDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BudgetingDashboard.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Manage Journals — Inquiry UI** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle features a pivot-style Inquiry with multi-dimension drill-down (Period, Ledger, Source, Category, Currency). Nexus has a flat table. Missing: Balance Inquiry cube navigation. |
| **Account Combinations (Accounting Flexfield)** | ⚠️ Partial | COA exists but lacks the KFF cross-validation rule (CVR) builder. Oracle lets you define rules like "Dept 1000 can only use Exp accounts 5000–5999." |
| **Subledger Accounting Workbench** | ❌ Missing | Oracle has a full SLA configuration UI: Event Classes, JLTs, ADRs, Mapping Sets. Nexus has the DB schema ([sla.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/sla.ts)) but no configurator UI. |
| **Financial Statement Generator (FSG)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle FSG lets accountants drag-and-drop account ranges into P&L / Balance Sheet templates. Nexus uses hardcoded report tables. |
| **Web ADI / ADFDI (Excel Upload)** | ❌ Missing | Mass journal upload via Excel spreadsheet with oracle-defined templates. Critical for month-end close entries. |
| **Mass Allocations Builder** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle has a form-based formula builder (Source, Basis, Target accounts) with statistical UOM support. Nexus has a simplified version without formula conditionals. |
| **Translation / Revaluation Program** | ❌ Missing | Automated currency translation at period end (ASC 830 / IAS 21). UI to select ledger, period, year-to-date rates. Missing UI and background processor. |
| **Open/Close Periods (per Subledger)** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle has granular period control at AP/AR/FA/INV subledger level with transition rules. Nexus controls periods at the Ledger level only. |
| **Statistical Ledger / Reporting Currency** | ❌ Missing | Oracle supports "Group" ledgers (consolidation ledgers) and stat ledgers for headcount/FTE data alongside financial data. |
| **GL Balance Cube Inquiry** | ❌ Missing | Oracle provides a live pivot table letting users select Any Dimension (Account, Period, Currency) and instantly see aggregated balances. |

### Key Field-Level Gaps (Journal Entry Form)
| Oracle Field | NexusAI Status |
|---|---|
| Journal Source | ✅ Exists |
| Journal Category | ✅ Exists |
| Accounting Period | ✅ Exists |
| Currency / Conversion Rate Type / Rate | ⚠️ Currency exists; Rate Type dropdown (Spot, Corporate, User) missing |
| Reversing Journal (Auto-Reverse checkbox) | ❌ Missing |
| Reference / Description per Line | ✅ Exists |
| Statistical Amount (for Statistical Ledger) | ❌ Missing |
| Encumbrance Type | ❌ Missing |
| Attachment / Supporting Doc upload | ⚠️ Generic file picker exists; not linked to journal record |

