## Module 2 — Accounts Payable (AP)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion Payables

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [SupplierInvoices.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SupplierInvoices.tsx) — Invoice list
- ✅ [VendorInvoiceEntry.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/VendorInvoiceEntry.tsx) — Invoice creation form
- ✅ [ThreeWayMatch.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ThreeWayMatch.tsx) — PO/Receipt/Invoice matching screen
- ✅ [PaymentScheduling.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PaymentScheduling.tsx) — Payment batch setup
- ✅ [PaymentFlow.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PaymentFlow.tsx)
- ✅ `finance/` ap sub-directory — approval flows, holds, payment runs
- ✅ [ApprovalWorkflow.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ApprovalWorkflow.tsx) / [ApprovalEscalations.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ApprovalEscalations.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Invoice Workbench** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle's workbench is a tabbed, multi-line form with PO matching, distributions, holds, and scheduled payments in one view. Nexus splits these across pages. |
| **2-Way / 3-Way / 4-Way Match UI** | ⚠️ Partial | ThreeWayMatch exists but lacks configurable tolerance definitions (Qty Variance %, Price Variance %), inspection holds (4-way), and match-in-full vs. partial match controls. |
| **Payment Process Request (PPR)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle's payment run engine. Allows selecting invoices by Due Date, Pay Group, Bank Account, generating an ISO 20022 / NACHA payment file. Nexus has static payment scheduling but no PPR execution. |
| **Withholding Tax (WHT) Setup & Extraction** | ❌ Missing | Oracle auto-calculates WHT at invoice/payment time. Exposes a "Withholding Tax Groups" form and generates WHT certificates for vendors. |
| **Supplier Merge** | ❌ Missing | Merging duplicate supplier records and re-pointing all transactions. |
| **Invoice Holds & Release Workbench** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle has a Hold Types configurator (matching holds, manual holds, tax holds). Nexus has generic approval hold status. |
| **Create Accounting (AP → GL)** | ❌ Missing | The background worker that runs SLA rules and posts AP journals to the GL. Nexus posts directly with no SLA intermediary. |
| **Payables Open Interface (Import)** | ❌ Missing | Bulk invoice import via staging tables from external systems. |
| **Invoice Installments / Payment Schedule Tab** | ❌ Missing | Oracle lets you split a single invoice into multiple payment installments with different due dates / discount dates. |

### Key Field-Level Gaps (Invoice Entry Form)
| Oracle Field | NexusAI Status |
|---|---|
| Invoice Number / Date / Type | ✅ Exists |
| Supplier / Supplier Site | ✅ Exists |
| Liability Account | ⚠️ Account picker exists; SLA-based derivation missing |
| Pay Group | ❌ Missing |
| Payment Priority (1–99) | ❌ Missing |
| Payment Terms (early pay discount logic) | ⚠️ Terms exist; discount calculation engine missing |
| Tax Classification Code | ⚠️ Basic tax code exists |
| Withholding Tax Group | ❌ Missing |
| Distribution Set | ❌ Missing |
| Invoice Lines → Distribution splits | ⚠️ Exists; lacks project costing distribution |
| Hold / Release (per line-level) | ❌ Missing |
| Recurring Invoice template | ❌ Missing |

