## Module 3 — Accounts Receivable (AR)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion Receivables

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [AccountsReceivable.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/AccountsReceivable.tsx) — AR dashboard
- ✅ [AccountsDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/AccountsDetail.tsx) — Customer account detail (large, 21KB)
- ✅ [AgingReport.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/AgingReport.tsx) — Aging buckets report
- ✅ [CreditManagementCollections.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/CreditManagementCollections.tsx)
- ✅ [InvoiceGenerator.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/InvoiceGenerator.tsx) / [InvoiceList.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/InvoiceList.tsx) / [InvoiceDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/InvoiceDetail.tsx)
- ✅ [RevenueForecasting.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/RevenueForecasting.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Transactions Workbench** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle's TX Workbench has Header + Lines tabs (goods/service lines with unit price, qty, tax), Distributions tab (auto-derived from AutoAccounting rules), and Freight lines. Nexus creates invoices at header level. |
| **AutoAccounting Setup** | ❌ Missing | Rules-based GL account derivation for AR (e.g., Revenue account = Salesperson territory + Product Line). |
| **AutoInvoice Import** | ❌ Missing | Mass import of invoices from OM/Projects via a mapping rule engine. |
| **Receipt Applications** | ⚠️ Partial | Basic receipt application exists. Missing: Line-level application, On-Account credits, Unapplied/Unidentified receipt resolution. |
| **Lockbox Processing (BAI2/EDI)** | ❌ Missing | Automated bank deposit file parsing and receipt auto-matching. |
| **Advanced Collections — Strategy Engine** | ❌ Missing | Daily scoring engine that advances customer delinquency through Step 1 (Email) → Step 2 (Call) → Step 3 (Legal based on score and days delinquent. |
| **Customer Profile Classes** | ⚠️ Partial | Credit limit exists at customer level. Missing: Profile Class template that cascades to thousands of customers (Credit limit, Payment Terms, Statement cycle). |
| **Debit Memos / Credit Memos** | ⚠️ Partial | Invoice creation exists; dedicated DM/CM transaction types with memo line reasons and auto-GL offsetting missing. |
| **Charge Back Setup** | ❌ Missing |
| **Dunning Letter Print / Email** | ❌ Missing | Oracle generates PDF dunning letters via BI Publisher or sends emails automatically. |
| **Adjustment Approvals** | ❌ Missing | Oracle routes AR adjustments above a threshold to a supervisor for approval |

### Key Field-Level Gaps (Customer Form)
| Oracle Field | NexusAI Status |
|---|---|
| Customer Number / Name | ✅ |
| Customer Class | ✅ |
| Account Status (Active/Inactive) | ✅ |
| Profile Class | ❌ Missing |
| Credit Limit / Currency | ⚠️ Exists but no auto-hold on new orders |
| Payment Terms | ✅ |
| Statement Cycle | ❌ Missing |
| AutoCash Rule Set | ❌ Missing |
| Collector | ❌ Missing |
| Lockbox Number | ❌ Missing |
| Ship-To / Bill-To Site | ✅ Partially |
| Tax Registration Number | ⚠️ |

