## Module 4 — Cash Management (CE)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion Cash Management

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [BankReconciliation.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BankReconciliation.tsx)
- ✅ [MatchRuleList.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/MatchRuleList.tsx) / [MatchRuleDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/MatchRuleDetail.tsx) — Auto-reconciliation rule definition
- ✅ `treasury/` sub-directory — Bank positions, FX
- ✅ [TreasuryCommandCenter.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/TreasuryCommandCenter.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Bank Statement Import (BAI2 / SWIFT MT940 / CAMT.053)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle parses bank statement files. Nexus requires manual entry. |
| **Auto-Reconciliation Engine** | ⚠️ Partial | Match rules exist (MatchRuleList) but the background engine that applies them automatically against imported statements is missing. |
| **Manual Reconciliation Dual-Pane UI** | ⚠️ Partial | Oracle has a drag-and-drop UI where unreconciled bank lines are on the left and system transactions on the right. Nexus has a simpler click-to-match. |
| **Bank Account Validation (IBAN/SWIFT)** | ❌ Missing |
| **Cash Forecasting Workbench** | ❌ Missing | Multi-day/week cash position forecast by bank account / currency. |
| **Notional Cash Pooling** | ❌ Missing | Grouping multiple bank accounts for interest optimization across entities. |
| **Bank Statement Line Exceptions Workbench** | ❌ Missing | Lines that could not be matched require a dedicated review UI with search / batch-correct. |

