## Module 5 — Fixed Assets (FA)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Fusion Assets

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [FixedAssetsPage.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/FixedAssetsPage.tsx) — Basic asset list
- ✅ `fixed-assets/` sub-directory (1 child page)
- ✅ [fixedAssets.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/fixedAssets.ts) schema — Very comprehensive (depreciation, leases, retirements)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Asset Workbench (Multi-tab)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle's main form has: Main (details), Books (depreciation rules per book), Assignments (employee, location, cost center), Source Lines (AP invoice links). |
| **Mass Additions Interface** | ❌ Missing | AP invoices coded to capital accounts flow into a queue. Accountants review, merge duplicate lines, and "capitalize" them into assets. |
| **Run Depreciation UI** | ❌ Missing | Oracle has a submission form: select Book, Period, and run. Background engine calculates depreciation and posts to GL. |
| **Asset Retirements Form** | ❌ Missing | Recording disposals/sales. Fields: Retirement Date, Units, Cost Retired, Proceeds of Sale, Gain/Loss Book. |
| **Asset Transfers** | ❌ Missing | Changing employee, location, or cost center. Generates cost transfer journal. |
| **Asset Reclassification** | ❌ Missing | Moving an asset between asset categories. |
| **Capital Projects Interface** | ❌ Missing | Assets under construction (CIP) tracked in Projects, then "placed in service" and transferred to FA. |
| **Tax Book Configuration** | ❌ Missing | Separate depreciation books for tax purposes (MACRS, Bonus Depreciation). |
| **Prorate Convention Setup** | ❌ Missing | Mid-Month, Half-Year, Full-Month timing rules for depreciation start. |
| **Physical Inventory Reconciliation** | ❌ Missing | Upload results of a barcode scan audit and reconcile against system records. |

