## Module 6 — Tax Engine (eBTax / E-Business Tax)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle E-Business Tax

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [TaxManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/TaxManagement.tsx) — 23KB, significant tax management UI
- ✅ `tax/` sub-directory — 6 pages
- ✅ [ComplianceTax.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ComplianceTax.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Tax Regime Definition** | ❌ Missing | Top of the hierarchy. Oracle Regime = "VAT" or "US Sales Tax." Nexus has flat tax codes. |
| **Tax Configuration (Regime → Tax → Status → Rate)** | ❌ Missing | The full 4-level hierarchy. Each level has its own setup form in Oracle. |
| **Determining Factor Sets** | ❌ Missing | Rules that determine which Tax applies based on Ship-From/To geography, item category, customer class. |
| **Tax Simulator** | ❌ Missing | Oracle has a simulator UI where a consultant can enter a mock transaction and see which tax rates were applied and by which rule. |
| **Supplier Tax Registration** | ⚠️ Partial | Tax registration number field exists. Missing: Country-specific validation, tax classification by regime. |
| **Tax Reporting (VAT Returns)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle generates output files for country-specific VAT submissions (Making Tax Digital in UK, etc.). |

