- ✅ [ExpenseManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ExpenseManagement.tsx) — 14.8KB, large primary expense page
- ✅ [ExpensesDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ExpensesDetail.tsx) — 26KB, very large detailed form
- ✅ [ExpenseTracking.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ExpenseTracking.tsx) — 14.5KB
- ✅ [ExpensePolicyManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ExpensePolicyManagement.tsx) — 11.8KB, policy rules  
- ✅ [ExpenseCalculators.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ExpenseCalculators.tsx) — 19.7KB, with calculators
