### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Expense Report Mobile App** | ❌ Missing | Oracle Expenses has a dedicated mobile UI with receipt photo capture using AI OCR for amount/merchant extraction. |
| **Audit Rule Sets** | ⚠️ Partial | Nexus has policy rules. Oracle has structured audit rule sets (e.g., "Auto-flag if hotel expense > policy limit by >20%"). |
| **Mileage Calculation Engine** | ⚠️ Partial | Nexus has calculators. Missing: Google Maps integration to validate start/end point and calculate IRS-rate mileage automatically. |
| **Per Diem Schedules** | ⚠️ Partial | Exists but lacks government-standard GSA rate tables by city/country. |
| **Cash Advance Reconciliation** | ❌ Missing | Tracking cash advances issued to employees and reconciling against submitted expense reports. |
| **Expense Reimbursement via Payroll** | ❌ Missing | Oracle can push approved expense reimbursements directly as payroll elements. |

